      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound and heavy thought, that vast indifference of the cosmos. While the universe may trend toward entropy, your personal experience of meaning is an active, temporary spark of consciousness in that vastness. Perhaps the point isn't in the eternal outcome, but in the brief, intense beauty of the noise itself. What small thing could you intentionally focus on today to make the moment feel a little less meaningless?",
